# OKF log.md files are append-only, one line per entry, so concurrent
# additions from parallel branches merge cleanly as a union. Duplicate or
# out-of-order date headings a union merge leaves behind are flagged by
# okf-validate.mjs; fold and re-sort, never reword. See the `log` command in
# skills/engineering/okf/commands.md.
log.md merge=union
